(15, '#18 Acumen', 'District 41', 'Division B', 'Area B1', 'Better than Yesterday', '2026-09-29', '18:00:00', '19:30:00', 'NPT', 'We provide a supportive and positive learning experience in which members are empowered to develop communication and leadership skills, resulting in greater self-confidence and personal growth', '\"Knowing is not enough; we must apply. Willing is not enough; we must do.\"', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goeth', 'Every Tuesday @ 18:00\r\nOnwards in Urban Kunj, Baneshwor, Kathmandu', '2026-09-29 09:12:30', '2026-09-29 09:12:59', 'Hone', 'To develop and improve something, especially a skill, over a period of time', 'Improve, Refine, Sharpen, Perfect', 'He joined the club to hone his leadership abilities', '[\"Better Evaluator\",\"Better Featured Speaker\",\"Better Table Topic Speaker\"]'),
(16, '#146 Academia, #170 Professionals and #155 Nabil', 'District 41', 'Division C', 'Area C1', 'Junk Food Vs Healthy Food', '2026-10-01', '18:00:00', '19:30:00', 'NPT', 'We provide a supportive and positive learning experience in which members are empowered to develop communication and leadership skills, resulting in greater self-confidence and personal growth', '\"Knowing is not enough; we must apply. Willing is not enough; we must do.\"', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goeth', 'Every Thursday @ 18:00\r\nOnwards in 7th Floor, Meeting Hall, Nabil Bank, Ghantaghar Branch, Kathmandu', '2026-09-30 13:37:14', '2026-10-01 11:21:55', 'Resilience (adjective)', 'the ability to bounce back, recover, or adapt successfully after facing stress, trauma, or difficult challenges', 'Toughness, Fortitude, Perseverance', 'Sita was remarkably resilient, turning setbacks into opportunities', '[\"Better Table Topic Speaker\"]'),
