(2334, '81', 'RITA KATWAL', '', '', '', 'ritakatwalsis@gmail.com', NULL, 'f6718de152a39288d99027370dc1bcee', '0', '9869756030', NULL, 'M', '', '', 'TM Rita Katwal is an optimistic person. A Mathematics teacher by profession who holds a Master’s degree in Mathematics from Mizoram University. She has completed 5 years of teaching in Sanskriti International School. Being a teacher allows her to motivate', '', NULL, '2', 0, '2023-11-01', 'N', 1, 'N'),
