(2380, '201', NULL, '', '', '', 'jennymanandhar@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, '0', '9863021658', NULL, 'M', '', '', 'I am a Teacher at Rato Bangala School, Teacher educator at Rato Bangala Foundation. I have served as president in Rato Bangala Toastmasters club in 2022-2023. I have taken Division PQD roles in two consecutive years 2022-2023 and 2023-2024.\nJenny Manandar is a Chartered President at Rato Bangala Toastmasters club, She was the Area O3 Director for the term 2020-21 ,President distinguished Area. Area N 1 Director . President distinguished Area. She is Professionally an unit coordinator at Rato Bangala School and Teacher educator at Rato Bangala Foundation.\n\nAs Division A Director for the term 2022-23, my top priority will be to maintain and build upon the quality that has been synonymous with the Toastmasters movement in Nepal, at club meetings, trainings, and events. Following our district vision, we will work to enhance the Toastmasters experience for each of our members and will help them achieve excellence in their Toastmasters journey. Together we will create a benchmark in quality experience and will grow in quality numbers this year. Let us all work together to make a difference.', '', NULL, '2', 0, NULL, 'N', 1, 'N'),
